[00:03.98]See the colours turn from gold
{"看那金色逐渐褪去"}
[00:07.51]I'm left here hiding in the cold
{"我独自蜷缩在寒冷里"}
[00:11.22]My heart's still beating strong and bold
{"心跳依然强健有力"}
[00:14.59]And I pray, I pray
{"我祈祷 我祈祷"}
[00:17.78]
[00:18.75]In the darkness of the storm
{"在暴风雨的黑暗中"}
[00:22.62]Someone save me hear me call
{"谁能听见我的呼救"}
[00:26.39]I will stand and I might fall
{"我会站起或会跌倒"}
[00:29.67]And I pray, I pray
{"我祈祷 我祈祷"}
[00:33.00]
[00:34.36]Take me home, take me one step higher
{"带我回家 再攀高一步"}
[00:38.20]Come alive, you're my one desire
{"苏醒吧 你是我唯一渴求"}
[00:41.90]I would walk through the open fire
{"我愿穿越熊熊烈火"}
[00:45.18]When lights start fading, I'll be waiting
{"当光芒渐暗 我会守候"}
